  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation and Monitoring program of the Leatherback and black sea turtle nesting in North Pacific Costa Rica.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) training field teams to conduct nighttime nesting survey and protection patrols at several of the key remaining nesting sites; Playa Langosta, Playa Nombre de Jesus, Zapotilla, Onda and Real; 2) relocation of nests to safe beach hatcheries; and 3) environmental education and outreach to local schools with field trips and a turtle festival..</narrative>
  </description>
